{"schema_version": "optomind-event.v1", "run_id": "cloud-repair-restore-ar-05", "seq": 22, "event_type": "prompt_assembled", "time": "2026-10-13T10:43:01.782551+00:00", "payload": {"route_id": "route_01", "stage": "task_compiler", "question": "Execute a deterministic TMM optimization for a planar stack: Incident Medium Air (n=1.0), Layer 1 SiO2 (Gao) (lossless, n=1.46), Layer 2 TiO2 (Siefke) (lossless, n=2.40), Substrate Glass (lossless, n=1.52). Optimize the thickness of Layer 1 and Layer 2 simultaneously. Constraints: Thickness of each layer must be between 40 nm and 160 nm. Objective: Minimize the arithmetic mean of power reflectance for s-polarized light at normal incidence (0 degrees) sampled from 450 nm to 700 nm in 5 nm steps. Use seed 17. Allow maximum 64 solver evaluations. Report the best found thickness pair, the resulting reflectance spectrum, and the calculated mean reflectance.\n\nImmutable original user request (overrides conflicting route proposals):\nDesign a planar two-layer antireflection coating on a semi-infinite glass substrate (constant refractive index 1.52, lossless), with air incidence (index 1.0). Use only lossless constant-index SiO2 (n=1.46) and TiO2 (n=2.40), one layer of each in either order. Each layer thickness must be between 40 and 160 nm. At normal incidence with s polarization, minimize the arithmetic mean power reflectance sampled from 450 to 700 nm at 5 nm spacing. A mean reflectance below 0.03 is the stated target. Use deterministic TMM only, with no RCWA, FDFD, learned surrogate or hardware. Allow at most two executed research rounds with one route and at most 64 solver evaluations per round, seed 17. After observing the actual result, choose a justified adjustment or stop. Do not claim the target was met without the spectrum and independent numeric check.\nPreserve its physical constraints. Performance targets remain soft objectives.", "input_sha256": "5cce25bf99b83f88b3def4bb72ebb1dd546d4890013f97a312c7ec39dfde4282", "force_mock": null}, "parent_event": "sequence:22", "prev_hash": "1e0b2ba370591b1398044997d9380ca7c597f6f3cb1f087d086b3b317dac1145", "entry_hash": "65103c8a321e2c2f4f3ba57d6c6ecc894e1041501c9841deb56ecf9b17b738c0"}
